# Fix member-selected variable must have randmode

- Source URL: https://github.com/verilator/verilator/issues/6800

@YilouWang thanks for last fix, alas the same uvm-test tests/70regs/80examples/01model/30nofield got further but now resulted in a new error:

```
%Error: Internal Error: t/t_0.v:41:31: ../V3Randomize.cpp:901: Member-selected variable must have randmode in its class
   41 |     constraint _dummy_is_reg {_dummy.value == value;}
      |                               ^~~~~~
```

Rewritten test:

```
package uvm_pkg;
  virtual class uvm_object;
  endclass

  class uvm_sequence_item;
  endclass

  virtual class uvm_sequencer_param_base;
    function void send_request(uvm_sequence_item t);
      uvm_sequence_item par;
      if (0 == par.randomize()) begin
      end
    endfunction
  endclass

  class uvm_reg_item extends uvm_sequence_item;
    rand uvm_object extension;
  endclass

  class uvm_reg_field extends uvm_object;
    rand int value;
    virtual function bit get_rand_mode();
      return bit'(value.rand_mode());
    endfunction
  endclass

endpackage

program t;
  import uvm_pkg::*;

  class reg_r extends uvm_object;
    rand int value;
    local rand uvm_reg_field _dummy;
    constraint _dummy_is_reg {_dummy.value == value;}
  endclass

  initial begin
    reg_r r;
    r = new;
    $finish;
  end
endprogram
```
